sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as 应用
    participant DI as AddPermission
    participant B as 调用边界
    participant C as IPermissionChecker
    participant G as IScopeGuard
    participant R as IScopeSubjectResolver

    App->>DI: p.Scan(assembly)
    DI-->>App: 注册模型与要求来源
    App->>B: 查询列表 / 删除订单
    opt 有 [Permission] 且经过宿主工厂
        B->>B: 解析出 MethodInfo
        B->>C: EnsureResolvedAsync()（预热）
        C->>G: EnsureResolvedAsync()
        G->>R: ResolveAsync(user)
        R-->>G: ScopeSubjectSet（dept、grant）
        B->>C: IsGranted("order:delete")
        C-->>B: true / false
        B->>B: false ⇒ SecurityException
    end
    B->>G: EnsureResolvedAsync()（已预热）
    B->>G: Apply(orders) / Allows(order, id)
    G-->>B: 可见行 / 单行结论
    B-->>App: visible=o-1 / delete(o-1)=True
